---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 책장
description: 읽는 중 · 완독 · 읽고 싶은 책.
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import bookRow -%}
{%- set reading = books | where("status", "reading") -%}
{%- set done = books | where("status", "done") -%}
{%- set want = books | where("status", "want") -%}
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <p class="page-head__label">reading log</p>
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Bookshelf</h1>
    <p class="page-head__intro">읽는 중, 완독, 읽고 싶은 책. 개인 프로젝트의 일부입니다.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="container container--narrow">
  {%- if reading.length -%}<div class="book-group"><h2>읽는 중</h2>{%- for b in reading -%}{{ bookRow(b, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
  {%- if done.length -%}<div class="book-group"><h2>완독</h2>{%- for b in done -%}{{ bookRow(b, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
  {%- if want.length -%}<div class="book-group"><h2>읽고 싶은</h2>{%- for b in want -%}{{ bookRow(b, "ko") }}{%- endfor -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
</div>
